IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P8-gate`

-- P8-art75c: Article 75c, non-compliance, fines and periodic penalty payments (inserted by the Omnibus, `▼M1 INSERTED`). LAYER 1.
-- Group General (from 2 August 2026). Only the amended text exists: the Article is new.
-- The amounts of fines are in Article 99, outside this part (lines 1113-1313); this module asks only what the Article itself decides.
-- The consolidated text is a rendering with no legal effect.

DECLARE `Art 75c act` IS ONE OF
    `Art 75c(1) adopt a decision establishing the non-compliance`
    `Art 75c(2) communicate the preliminary findings to the operator concerned before adopting the decision`
    `Art 75c(3) order the operator to take the necessary measures within a reasonable period and to provide information on the measures`
    `Art 75c(3) provide the AI Office with a description of the measures taken to ensure compliance with the decision upon their implementation`
    `Art 75c(3) engage in a structured dialogue with the operator before requesting any measure`
    `Art 75c(3) propose commitments in accordance with Article 75b during the structured dialogue`
    `Art 75c(4)(a) infringe an applicable provision of this Regulation`
    `Art 75c(4)(b) fail to comply with a decision or measure adopted pursuant to the powers listed in Article 14(4) or Article 16(3) of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 or specified in Article 75a`
    `Art 75c(4)(c) fail to comply with a commitment made binding by a decision pursuant to Article 75b`
    `Art 75c(4) supply incorrect, incomplete or misleading information to the AI Office in reply to a request`
    `Art 75c(5) adopt a decision imposing periodic penalty payments`
    `Art 75c(5) impose a periodic penalty payment per day above the limit`
    `Art 75c(6) cancel, reduce or increase the fine or periodic penalty payment imposed`
    `Art 75c(8) exercise the powers of the AI Office after the limitation period has expired`
    `Art 75c(8) enforce a decision after the limitation period has expired`
    `Art 75c(9) close the proceeding by a decision`

DECLARE `Art 75c(5) purpose of the periodic penalty payments` IS ONE OF
    `Art 75c(5)(a) to submit to an investigation`
    `Art 75c(5)(b) to comply with an information request ordered by a decision adopted under Article 75a(3)`
    `Art 75c(5)(c) to submit to an inspection ordered by a decision pursuant to Article 75a(4)`
    `Art 75c(5)(d) to provide correct or complete answers or explanations in the context of an inspection ordered by a decision pursuant to Article 75a(4)`
    `Art 75c(5)(e) to comply with corrective actions ordered pursuant to the power listed in Article 16 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020`
    `Art 75c(5)(f) to comply with commitments made legally binding by a decision pursuant to Article 75b`
    `Art 75c(5)(g) to comply with a decision pursuant to paragraph (1) of this Article`
    `Art 75c(5) any other purpose that the list does not name`

§ `Article 75c(1) to (3): the decision of non-compliance`

-- src:1228 | 1. Where the AI Office finds that an operator falling within the scope of Article 75(1) does not comply with the relevant provisions of this Regulation or with commitments made binding pursuant to Article 75b, it shall adopt a decision establishing such non-compliance.
@ref Art 75c(1) (src:1228)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI Office finds that an operator falling within the scope of Article 75(1) does not comply with the relevant provisions of this Regulation or with commitments made binding pursuant to Article 75b` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 75c(1) the AI Office must adopt a decision establishing the non-compliance` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE IF `the AI Office finds that an operator falling within the scope of Article 75(1) does not comply with the relevant provisions of this Regulation or with commitments made binding pursuant to Article 75b`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where the AI Office finds that an operator ... does not comply ..., it shall adopt a decision establishing such non-compliance" (an unmet "where" gate counts as the text's no: ruling (b)) (fork F-75c-1-duty)

-- src:1228 | 1. Where the AI Office finds that an operator falling within the scope of Article 75(1) does not comply with the relevant provisions of this Regulation or with commitments made binding pursuant to Article 75b, it shall adopt a decision establishing such non-compliance.
@ref Art 75c(1) (src:1228)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI Office finds that an operator falling within the scope of Article 75(1) does not comply with the relevant provisions of this Regulation or with commitments made binding pursuant to Article 75b` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 75c act`
`Art 75c(1) the AI Office's duty to adopt a decision establishing the non-compliance` MEANS
    IF (NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)) OR (NOT `the AI Office finds that an operator falling within the scope of Article 75(1) does not comply with the relevant provisions of this Regulation or with commitments made binding pursuant to Article 75b`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the group General does not apply on the date asked, or the conditions of the duty are not met
    ELSE
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party AI Office`
        MUST `Art 75c(1) adopt a decision establishing the non-compliance`
        HENCE FULFILLED

-- src:1229 | 2. Before adopting a decision pursuant to paragraph 1, the AI Office shall communicate its preliminary findings to the operator concerned. In the preliminary findings, the AI Office shall explain the measures that it is considering taking, or that it considers that the operator concerned should take, in order to effectively address the preliminary findings.
@ref Art 75c(2) first sentence (src:1229)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI Office is about to adopt a decision pursuant to paragraph 1` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 75c(2) first sentence the AI Office must communicate its preliminary findings to the operator concerned` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE IF `the AI Office is about to adopt a decision pursuant to paragraph 1`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Before adopting a decision pursuant to paragraph 1, the AI Office shall communicate its preliminary findings" (an unmet "before" gate counts as the text's no: ruling (c)) (fork F-75c-2-first-duty)

-- src:1229 | 2. Before adopting a decision pursuant to paragraph 1, the AI Office shall communicate its preliminary findings to the operator concerned. In the preliminary findings, the AI Office shall explain the measures that it is considering taking, or that it considers that the operator concerned should take, in order to effectively address the preliminary findings.
@ref Art 75c(2) first sentence (src:1229)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI Office is about to adopt a decision pursuant to paragraph 1` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 75c act`
`Art 75c(2) first sentence the AI Office's duty to communicate its preliminary findings to the operator` MEANS
    IF (NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)) OR (NOT `the AI Office is about to adopt a decision pursuant to paragraph 1`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the group General does not apply on the date asked, or the conditions of the duty are not met
    ELSE
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party AI Office`
        MUST `Art 75c(2) communicate the preliminary findings to the operator concerned before adopting the decision`
        HENCE FULFILLED

-- src:1229 | 2. Before adopting a decision pursuant to paragraph 1, the AI Office shall communicate its preliminary findings to the operator concerned. In the preliminary findings, the AI Office shall explain the measures that it is considering taking, or that it considers that the operator concerned should take, in order to effectively address the preliminary findings.
@ref Art 75c(2) second sentence (src:1229)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI Office communicates its preliminary findings` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the preliminary findings explain the measures that the AI Office is considering taking, or that it considers that the operator concerned should take` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 75c(2) second sentence the preliminary findings explain the measures that the AI Office is considering taking or that the operator should take` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE IF `the AI Office communicates its preliminary findings` AND `the preliminary findings explain the measures that the AI Office is considering taking, or that it considers that the operator concerned should take`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "In the preliminary findings, the AI Office shall explain the measures" (a bare "shall" not done, taken case by case)

-- src:1230 | 3. In the decision pursuant to paragraph 1 of this Article, the AI Office shall, where relevant, order the operator concerned to take the necessary measures to ensure compliance with the relevant provisions of this Regulation within a reasonable period specified therein and to provide information on the measures that that operator intends to take to comply with the decision. The operator concerned shall provide the AI Office with a description of the measures it has taken to ensure compliance with the decision upon their implementation. Prior to requesting any measure, the AI Office may engage in a structured dialogue with the operator of the AI system in question. During this dialogue, the operator may propose commitments in accordance with Article 75b.
@ref Art 75c(3) first sentence (src:1230)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI Office adopts the decision pursuant to paragraph 1` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the order is relevant` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 75c(3) first sentence the AI Office must order the operator to take the necessary measures within a reasonable period and to provide information on the measures` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE IF `the AI Office adopts the decision pursuant to paragraph 1` AND `the order is relevant`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "In the decision pursuant to paragraph 1 of this Article, the AI Office shall, where relevant, order" (an unmet "where relevant" gate counts as the text's no: ruling (b)) (fork F-75c-3-first-duty)

-- src:1230 | 3. In the decision pursuant to paragraph 1 of this Article, the AI Office shall, where relevant, order the operator concerned to take the necessary measures to ensure compliance with the relevant provisions of this Regulation within a reasonable period specified therein and to provide information on the measures that that operator intends to take to comply with the decision. The operator concerned shall provide the AI Office with a description of the measures it has taken to ensure compliance with the decision upon their implementation. Prior to requesting any measure, the AI Office may engage in a structured dialogue with the operator of the AI system in question. During this dialogue, the operator may propose commitments in accordance with Article 75b.
@ref Art 75c(3) first sentence (src:1230)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI Office adopts the decision pursuant to paragraph 1` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the order is relevant` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 75c act`
`Art 75c(3) first sentence the AI Office's duty to order the operator to take the necessary measures` MEANS
    IF (NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)) OR (NOT `the AI Office adopts the decision pursuant to paragraph 1`) OR (NOT `the order is relevant`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the group General does not apply on the date asked, or the conditions of the duty are not met
    ELSE
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party AI Office`
        MUST `Art 75c(3) order the operator to take the necessary measures within a reasonable period and to provide information on the measures`
        HENCE FULFILLED

-- src:1230 | 3. In the decision pursuant to paragraph 1 of this Article, the AI Office shall, where relevant, order the operator concerned to take the necessary measures to ensure compliance with the relevant provisions of this Regulation within a reasonable period specified therein and to provide information on the measures that that operator intends to take to comply with the decision. The operator concerned shall provide the AI Office with a description of the measures it has taken to ensure compliance with the decision upon their implementation. Prior to requesting any measure, the AI Office may engage in a structured dialogue with the operator of the AI system in question. During this dialogue, the operator may propose commitments in accordance with Article 75b.
@ref Art 75c(3) second sentence (src:1230)
