      `the operator has implemented the measures to ensure compliance with the decision` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 75c(3) second sentence the operator must provide the AI Office with a description of the measures it has taken to ensure compliance with the decision` MEANS
