§ `Article 75c(4): penalties and administrative fines`

-- src:1231 | 4. A decision adopted pursuant to paragraph 1 of this Article may be accompanied by the imposition of penalties in accordance with Article 99(3) to (7), which provisions shall apply mutatis mutandis to the AI Office in the execution of its supervision and enforcement tasks referred to in Article 75(1).
@ref Art 75c(4) first subparagraph (src:1231)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the decision was adopted pursuant to paragraph 1` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 75c(4) first subparagraph the decision may be accompanied by the imposition of penalties in accordance with Article 99(3) to (7)` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE IF `the decision was adopted pursuant to paragraph 1`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the power is for "A decision adopted pursuant to paragraph 1"; the penalties themselves are in Article 99, which points outside this part

-- src:1232 | In particular, the following shall be subject to administrative fines as referred to in Article 99(4):
-- src:1233 | (a) infringement of any applicable provision of this Regulation, including those not listed in Article 99(4);
-- src:1234 | (b) failure to comply with decisions or measures adopted pursuant to the powers listed in Article 14(4) or Article 16(3) of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, as well as those specified in Article 75a of this Regulation;
-- src:1235 | (c) failure to comply with a commitment made binding by a decision pursuant to Article 75b.
@ref Art 75c(4) second subparagraph and points (a) to (c) (src:1232-1235)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the conduct is an infringement of any applicable provision of this Regulation, including those not listed in Article 99(4), a failure to comply with decisions or measures adopted pursuant to the powers listed in Article 14(4) or Article 16(3) of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 or specified in Article 75a, or a failure to comply with a commitment made binding by a decision pursuant to Article 75b` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 75c(4) second subparagraph the conduct is subject to administrative fines as referred to in Article 99(4)` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE IF `the conduct is an infringement of any applicable provision of this Regulation, including those not listed in Article 99(4), a failure to comply with decisions or measures adopted pursuant to the powers listed in Article 14(4) or Article 16(3) of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 or specified in Article 75a, or a failure to comply with a commitment made binding by a decision pursuant to Article 75b`
         THEN JUST TRUE  -- the conduct is within the list
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the list is introduced by "In particular, the following" and no "only" closes it (list not closed; split site (i), fork F-75c-4-list)

-- src:1232 | In particular, the following shall be subject to administrative fines as referred to in Article 99(4):
-- src:1233 | (a) infringement of any applicable provision of this Regulation, including those not listed in Article 99(4);
@ref Art 75c(4) second subparagraph point (a) (src:1232-1233)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the operator is subject to the supervision and enforcement tasks of the AI Office referred to in Article 75(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 75c act`
`Art 75c(4)(a) the operator's bar on infringing an applicable provision of this Regulation` MEANS
    IF (NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)) OR (NOT `the operator is subject to the supervision and enforcement tasks of the AI Office referred to in Article 75(1)`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is barred: the group General does not apply on the date asked, or the facts the bar is about do not all hold
    ELSE
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party operator`
        SHANT `Art 75c(4)(a) infringe an applicable provision of this Regulation`
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST BREACH BY `Arts 72 to 79 party operator` BECAUSE "the infringement of an applicable provision of this Regulation is subject to administrative fines as referred to in Article 99(4)"

-- src:1232 | In particular, the following shall be subject to administrative fines as referred to in Article 99(4):
