    IF `Art 75c(8) first subparagraph the powers of the AI Office are barred by the limitation period on the date asked` `the date asked` `the date the infringement is committed` `the infringement is continuing or repeated` `the date the infringement ceases` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party AI Office`
        SHANT `Art 75c(8) exercise the powers of the AI Office after the limitation period has expired`
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST BREACH BY `Arts 72 to 79 party AI Office` BECAUSE "the powers were exercised after the limitation period of five years had run"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is barred on these facts

